      "en": "All you animals of the field, come to devour, all you animals in the forest.",
      "ko": "들의 짐승들아 삼림 중의 짐승들아 다 와서 삼키라",
      "source_text_hash": "b4bfb319331036a914aec336aefc40ac0ac5791bb2b1c6eddb2aaf9b72c89de4",
      "translation_text_hash": "537e32d055676be115cd0071de0519b016b240329fa137cd9ea35b8fd6b8f68c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
