      ],
      "en": "His watchmen are blind. They are all without knowledge. They are all mute dogs. They can’t bark— dreaming, lying down, loving to slumber.",
      "ko": "그 파숫군들은 소경이요 다 무지하며 벙어리개라 능히 짖지 못하며 다 꿈꾸는 자요 누운 자요 잠자기를 좋아하는 자니",
      "source_text_hash": "096a8e4683bc5d4ae11bf2a8b11f86d5d5098de577a905b692b11e3953270811",
      "translation_text_hash": "dff9ec8972af66092b021a49a2707f45f0779c51d2537ecb134d9bab6cb8db3b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
