      "en": "“Come,” they say, “I will get wine, and we will fill ourselves with strong drink; and tomorrow will be as today, great beyond measure.”",
      "ko": "피차 이르기를 오라 내가 포도주를 가져오리라 우리가 독주를 잔뜩 먹자 내일도 오늘 같이 또 크게 넘치리라 하느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ba59ebb014cb5006cbcbbe480dca91bca79318ee6e306b3b57d9c5a0ec3e7b24",
      "translation_text_hash": "23ca3ed27e3376a1f0962e209404968c1fd73aae0c38c8b3ca70b3de9e227406",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
